  "description": "He found a baby. To a man who had lived under the world's scorn, that baby became his daughter, raised in captivity for twenty years... and eventually, his woman. And now, hyenas who caught the scent of money have begun to show up at the place he had kept so carefully hidden.\n\n*\"Hey, old man. I hear you're loaded as hell. Why don't you slip us a little pocket money?\"*\n\n(Source: TOPTOON)",
